msgid "Target путь (хост)"
msgstr "Target path (host)"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:152
msgid "``services/ecos-community-demo-data/zookeeper-app/data/version-2/``"
msgstr "``services/ecos-community-demo-data/zookeeper-app/data/version-2/``"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:153
msgid ""
"``/opt/citeck/data/runtime/default/volumes/zookeeper2/data/version-2/`` "
"(snapshots) + "
"``/opt/citeck/data/runtime/default/volumes/zookeeper2/datalog/version-2/`` "
"(logs)"
msgstr ""
"``/opt/citeck/data/runtime/default/volumes/zookeeper2/data/version-2/`` "
"(snapshots) + "
"``/opt/citeck/data/runtime/default/volumes/zookeeper2/datalog/version-2/`` "
"(logs)"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:155
msgid "Особенности:"
msgstr "Notes:"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:157
msgid ""
"**Source (Bitnami)** хранит и снэпшоты, и transaction log в одном каталоге "
"``version-2/``."
msgstr ""
"**Source (Bitnami)** stores both snapshots and the transaction log in a "
"single ``version-2/`` directory."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:158
msgid ""
"**Target (official zookeeper)** разделяет: ``data/version-2/`` для снэпшотов"
" и служебных файлов (``acceptedEpoch``, ``currentEpoch``), "
"``datalog/version-2/`` для transaction log. Если их не разделить, target "
"падает с ``SnapDirContentCheckException``."
msgstr ""
"**Target (official zookeeper)** separates them: ``data/version-2/`` for "
"snapshots and auxiliary files (``acceptedEpoch``, ``currentEpoch``), "
"``datalog/version-2/`` for the transaction log. If they are not separated, "
"the target fails with ``SnapDirContentCheckException``."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:159
msgid ""
"Хранилище в launcher2 -- это bind-mount каталог на хосте (не named docker "
"volume). Точный путь можно подтвердить через ``docker inspect "
"citeck_zookeeper_default --format '{{(index .Mounts 0).Source}}'``."
msgstr ""
"Storage in launcher2 is a bind-mount directory on the host (not a named "
"docker volume). The exact path can be confirmed via ``docker inspect "
"citeck_zookeeper_default --format '{{(index .Mounts 0).Source}}'``."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:162
msgid "Предусловия"
msgstr "Prerequisites"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:165
msgid "0. Резервный backup source ДО любых действий"
msgstr "0. Back up source BEFORE any actions"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:167
msgid ""
"Это страховка на случай, если апгрейд до 2026.1 (предусловие 1) сломает "
"старый сервер. **Backup НЕ используется для миграции** -- только для отката "
"source."
msgstr ""
"This is a safety net in case the upgrade to 2026.1 (prerequisite 1) breaks "
"the old server. **The backup is NOT used for migration** — only for rolling "
"back the source."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:169
msgid "Простейший вариант (с остановкой сервера):"
msgstr "Simplest option (with server shutdown):"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:179
msgid ""
"Если останавливать сервер нельзя -- ``pg_dumpall`` + ``mongodump`` + копия "
"каталога zookeeper в горячем режиме на работающих контейнерах."
msgstr ""
"If the server cannot be stopped — ``pg_dumpall`` + ``mongodump`` + a hot "
"copy of the zookeeper directory on running containers."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:182
msgid "1. Source обновлён до релиза 2026.1"
msgstr "1. Source updated to release 2026.1"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:184
msgid ""
"Это снимает риск рассинхронизации schema/changelog при заливке в launcher2 "
"(тоже 2026.1). В каталоге ``citeck-community``:"
msgstr ""
"This eliminates the risk of schema/changelog desynchronization when loading "
"into launcher2 (also 2026.1). In the ``citeck-community`` directory:"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:191
msgid ""
