"запуска -- в этапе 1."
msgstr ""
"``citeck-launcher`` version ≥ 2.x is installed, bundle ``community:2026.1`` "
"or ``enterprise:2026.1`` (depending on your license). First-run details are "
"in Stage 1."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:203
msgid "3. Свободное место"
msgstr "3. Free disk space"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:205
