msgstr "No manual lookup required:"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:264
msgid "PostgreSQL: ``postgres / postgres`` (захардкожено в launcher2)."
msgstr "PostgreSQL: ``postgres / postgres`` (hardcoded in launcher2)."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:265
msgid ""
"MongoDB: пароль root сгенерирован launcher'ом, читается через ``docker exec "
"citeck_mongo_default printenv MONGO_INITDB_ROOT_PASSWORD``. Команды импорта "
"в этапе 4 берут его именно так."
msgstr ""
"MongoDB: the root password is generated by the launcher and read via "
"``docker exec citeck_mongo_default printenv MONGO_INITDB_ROOT_PASSWORD``. "
"Import commands in Stage 4 use this approach."

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:268
msgid "Этап 2. Выгрузка с source"
msgstr "Stage 2. Exporting from source"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:270
msgid ""
"Все команды этого этапа выполняются на старом сервере, **из каталога** "
"``citeck-community``. Используются service-имена из ``docker-compose.yaml``:"
msgstr ""
"All commands in this stage are executed on the old server, **from the** "
"``citeck-community`` **directory**. Service names from ``docker-"
"compose.yaml`` are used:"

#: ../../admin/launch_setup/launcher_server/migration_from_compose.rst:272
